**Profile**: Title: Averardo Vault, Origin: Rinascita.

{{Intro/Location|Averardo Vault}} Built by the [[Montelli Family]], Averardo Vault stands like a heavily guarded fortress on the outskirts of the city. Within its walls lies the family's vast collection of treasures, including precious metals, artworks, and rare Echoes. The vault also provides public services such as secure storage for valuables, appraisals, and acquisition of rare collections.

